flowchart TB
  accTitle: Checkpoint and uninterrupted training branches
  accDescr: Fork the same complete training state at a chosen step. One branch continues; the other saves and reloads before continuing on identical remaining batches. Compare post-reload evaluation logits and subsequent losses and parameters.
  S["State at step k: weights, moments, schedule, RNG, cursor"] --> U["Uninterrupted continuation"]
  S --> C["Save → rebuild → restore full state"]
  C --> R["Resumed continuation"]
  B["Identical remaining batch sequence"] --> U
  B --> R
  U --> V["Compare each remaining step"]
  R --> V
